1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:02,690
(Amy:)You slept with him?

2
00:00:03,096 --> 00:00:06,726
(Penny:)I didn't know what else to do.
He had those big, sad eyes.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,530
(Bernadette:)Oh, sure, you had no choice.

4
00:00:12,872 --> 00:00:15,572
(Penny:)He looked at me like this.

5
00:00:18,545 --> 00:00:21,745
(Amy:)If that's all it takes,
it's a good thing you don't have a dog.

6
00:00:25,785 --> 00:00:28,875
(Bernadette:)Don't worry, you'll have plenty
of chances to break up with him.

7
00:00:29,055 --> 00:00:32,855
(Bernadette:)Your wedding day, your honeymoon,
your 50th anniversary.

8
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:35,456
(Penny:)Look, it's fine,
we're not getting married, okay?

9
00:00:35,628 --> 00:00:39,688
(Penny:)We're keeping things, you know,
homeostasis.

10
00:00:41,367 --> 00:00:43,797
(Amy:)It's so cute when she tries.

11
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:50,865
(Penny(phone text tone):)It's from Leonard.

12
00:00:51,044 --> 00:00:53,244
"Last night was amazing.
You're amazing.

13
00:00:53,413 --> 00:00:56,503
I'm so lucky to have you in my life."

14
00:00:58,885 --> 00:01:00,285
(Penny(phone text tone):)Okay, stop it.

15
00:01:05,491 --> 00:01:09,121
(Howard:)Hey, Bernie, guess what? I stood up
to the other astronauts like you said.

16
00:01:09,295 --> 00:01:12,495
And I gotta tell you last night
was the first time in a week...

17
00:01:12,665 --> 00:01:14,185
(Howard:)...I got a good night's sleep.

18
00:01:21,874 --> 00:01:24,304
(Bernadette:)Oh, Howie.

19
00:01:24,477 --> 00:01:26,537
(Howard:)What's wrong? You look upset.

20
00:01:26,713 --> 00:01:27,943
(Sheldon(measures):)Nope.

21
00:01:28,114 --> 00:01:30,704
(Bernadette:)This is my proud face.

